				<wikidot:authorName>Gabriel Jade</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>414239</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Sincere thanks to valued critters <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1537998730" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" >RockTeethMothEyes</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1537998730" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>. This was inspired by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1537998730" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" >Doctor Cimmerian</a></span>'s tale &quot;Now Hollow Fires Burn Out To Black And Lights Are Guttering Low&quot;, to which this was made as a prequel.</p> <p>The title of the tale is a reference to a poem by Dogen, which you'll find in it its entirety here:</p> <blockquote> <p>An explosive shout cracks the great empty sky.<br /> Immediately clear self-understanding.<br /> Swallow up buddhas and ancestors of the past.<br /> Without following others, realize complete penetration.<br /> <br /> <strong>Dogen</strong><br /> Moon in a Dewdrop<br /> Translated by Kazuaki Tanahashi</p> </blockquote> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">A&nbsp;list&nbsp;of&nbsp;references</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">For&nbsp;the&nbsp;curious</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-008">SCP-008</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-049">SCP-049</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-173">SCP-173</a>, and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/kain-pathos-crow-s-author-page">Kain Pathos Crow.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> 
